  "changelog": "Initial public release.\n\nLightweight Flask web interface for OpenClaw providing a simple browser chat UI.\n\nFeatures:\n- Multi-user chat interface\n- Proxy to OpenClaw HTTP endpoint\n- Configurable upstream agent and model\n- Environment-based configuration\n- Local state and memory storage\n\nConfiguration via environment variables:\n\nOPENCLAW_BASE=http://127.0.0.1:18789\nOPENCLAW_AUTH=\nOPENCLAW_AGENT=main\nOPENCLAW_CHANNEL=web-gateway\nOPENCLAW_MODEL=default\nDEFAULT_USER=family\nPORT=5002",
